#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:340
msgid "These features carry virtually no security risk. They serve AI-optimized versions of your existing content and broadcast your data-use preferences — no interactive access is granted."
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:349
msgid "Markdown Content Negotiation"
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:350
msgid "Content Score"
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:352
msgid "When an AI agent requests your pages with an Accept: text/markdown header, the plugin intercepts that request and returns a clean, stripped Markdown version of your content instead of HTML. This reduces noise, token usage, and improves comprehension by AI models."
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:354
#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:393
#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:476
#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:793
msgid "Why this matters"
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:356
msgid "HTML is roughly 80% structural noise — navigation, footers, scripts, and ads. By serving clean Markdown, you ensure AI agents capture your brand voice accurately and cite your facts without being confused by website code."
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:357
msgid "Cloudflare's Agent Readiness benchmark grades your Content Score on how efficiently your content reaches an LLM. Reducing token waste directly improves how models like Claude, Gemini, and GPT-4o read and represent your site."
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:363
msgid "Active: sends Vary: Accept with all frontend pages."
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:367
msgid "Toggle Markdown Negotiation"
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:376
msgid "Also serve Markdown at its own address"
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:376
msgid "and"
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:378
msgid "For agents that do not send an Accept header, or CDNs that strip it. Adding .md to a page address is the convention the llms.txt proposal uses."
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:379
msgid "Every HTML page points to its Markdown version with a rel=\"alternate\" link. Each Markdown version opens with its title, address, author and dates, and names the HTML page as the canonical copy so search engines never treat it as duplicate content. Markdown is never stored in a page cache, so every AI crawler fetch is logged and marked \"Markdown\" in AI Crawler Watch."
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:388
msgid "llms.txt Generator"
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:389
msgid "Discoverability Score"
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:391
msgid "Generates a dynamic machine-readable \"cheat sheet\" for AI models at /llms.txt. It includes your site name, tagline, and a structured list of your most recent pages with links and excerpts — giving AI tools an instant overview of your site without crawling every page."
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:395
msgid "Traditional sitemaps are built for link-crawlers. llms.txt is a \"Fast-Pass\" menu built for context — it lets AI agents map your entire site without wasting tokens parsing navigation menus, footers, or pagination."
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:396
msgid "Cloudflare's Agent Readiness benchmark grades your Discoverability Score based on how easily an agent can orient itself on your site, and llms.txt is one of the signals it checks."
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:400
msgid "Should I leave this on?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:402
msgid "How it works: /llms.txt is built by PHP on each request, so it always reflects your latest published pages and every AI crawler visit is recorded in the Crawler Log. Pages set to noindex in your SEO plugin, password-protected pages, and WooCommerce cart, checkout and account pages are left out."
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:403
msgid "Leave it on if you want AI tools to have a clean summary of your site and you want to see which AI crawlers ask for it. It costs one lightweight page load per request."
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:404
msgid "Turn it off if another plugin already serves /llms.txt, if you maintain a hand-written llms.txt file yourself, or if you would rather not publish a list of your recent pages. llms.txt is still a proposed standard, and not every AI company has said it reads the file, so switching it off does not hide your site from AI search."
msgstr ""

#. translators: plugin name
#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:419
#, php-format
msgid "Conflict: %s is generating a physical /llms.txt file. Delete it from that plugin or disable it here — only one can serve this path."
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:423
msgid "A physical /llms.txt file exists on disk. The web server serves it directly, bypassing this plugin. Delete it via FTP/cPanel if you want this plugin to control the output."
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:430
msgid "Toggle llms.txt"
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:439
msgid "Link each page to its Markdown version"
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:441
msgid "Lists /page.md addresses in llms.txt instead of the HTML pages, as the llms.txt proposal suggests. Needs Markdown Content Negotiation on. Off by default: every agent can read the HTML page, while not every agent looks for Markdown yet."
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:449
msgid "Agent Skills Index"
msgstr ""

#: admin/pages/class-page-ai-ready.php:450
msgid "Publishes a discovery index at /.well-known/agent-skills/index.json listing every AI capability this site exposes. AI agents read this file to understand what tools and APIs are available without crawling. Each skill entry includes a name, type, description, URL, and SHA-256 integrity hash."
